  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {blanked} = blanked (int) — {blanked} is a count: give one text per plural form
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A customer's words were erased on request. Messages blanked: {blanked}. The timeline keeps its shape." => { one: "En kunds ord raderades på begäran. Ett meddelande tömdes. Tidslinjen behåller sin form.", other: "En kunds ord raderades på begäran. {blanked} meddelanden tömdes. Tidslinjen behåller sin form." };
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {who} = who (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A message from {who} was split off into a conversation of its own." => "Ett meddelande från {who} delades av till en egen konversation.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {who} = who (string), {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A message from {who} was split off into a conversation of its own: “{why}”." => "Ett meddelande från {who} delades av till en egen konversation: ”{why}”.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {happened.Person} = happened.Person (string), {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A side conversation with {happened.Person} was started: “{why}”." => "En sidokonversation med {happened.Person} startades: ”{why}”.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A thread inside the team was started beside this: “{why}”." => "En tråd inom teamet startades bredvid det här: ”{why}”.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {happened.Person} = happened.Person (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "An automatic reply from {happened.Person} was received and not answered." => "Ett automatiskt svar från {happened.Person} togs emot och besvarades inte.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "An automatic reply was received and not answered." => "Ett automatiskt svar togs emot och besvarades inte.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Erased: it was kept for legal claims, and that period ended." => "Raderad: den sparades för rättsliga anspråk, och den perioden har tagit slut.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Erased: its period ended." => "Raderad: lagringstiden tog slut.";
