  /// shown through EventSentence()
  /// also in PrioritisedWords
  /// also in ToldHolderWords
  /// also in ToldLeadsWords
  text "Something happened." => "Något hände.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {who} = who (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Split off from another conversation, with {who}'s message." => "Avdelad från en annan konversation, med meddelandet från {who}.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {why} = why (string), {who} = who (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Split off from “{why}”, with {who}'s message." => "Avdelad från ”{why}”, med meddelandet från {who}.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "This message quoted another conversation's thread, but its sender is not in it — started separately." => "Meddelandet citerade en annan konversations tråd, men avsändaren finns inte med i den, så en ny konversation startades.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
